Alas fellows!

My wizard of orcish descent has passed the gate to the land from where no
traveller returns.

He was doing well, apart from the fact that it took him ages (first time
found a wand several levels below the castle) to acquire polymorph ability
so he could turn all the rubbish he collected into useful things. He was
good, my best so far. He'd wiped out L&h, Minotaurs and Disenchanters for
easier travelling.

So, what happened. I met Rodney. Stupid me, being so deep the first time I
thought I'd meet him further down, but so I had to fight him early. Killed
him four times, without problems. Something struck me with lightning, and
I got blind. No problem, use the old trusty Unicorn horn. Bad Idea(tm) as
it was cursed in between and I got sick. Still, no panic, I always carry
some holy water with me in my bag of holding but why waste that - I know
how to cast remove curse. So, I wield the Unicorn horn and, damnit, I
don't have my hands free for casting. OK, so I'll have to resort to the
potions, but now I can't loot my bag, still because I don't have my hands
free. Last resort, a prayer, only angered Moloch - I had gone too far from
the bosom of my God. And so I die, alone in the dark, never to see the sun
again.

| uli-Wiz-Orc-Mal-Cha was poisoned in Gehennom on level 47. 
| Poisoned by a unicorn horn. 

goodbye

